/S /H2
/T (The platform directly addresses these challenges through its modular, agent-centric architecture. It provides a native execution environment for AI agents to interact autonomously with smart contracts and blockchain state using standardised SDKs and protocol interfaces, thereby closing integration gaps with DApps. Domain-specific performance is achieved via fine-tuned models trained on blockchain-native data \(e.g. transaction logs, governance actions, and smart contract patterns\).)
/E (The platform directly addresses these challenges through its modular, agent-centric architecture. It provides a native execution environment for AI agents to interact autonomously with smart contracts and blockchain state using standardised SDKs and protocol interfaces, thereby closing integration gaps with DApps. Domain-specific performance is achieved via fine-tuned models trained on blockchain-native data \(e.g. transaction logs, governance actions, and smart contract patterns\).)
